H2216.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 3:19; 
son of: Pedaiah (H6305H); 
brother of: Shimei (H8096J); 
father of: Meshullam (H4918H), Hananiah (H2608L), Shelomith (H8019I), Hashubah (H2807), Ohel (H0169), Berechiah (H1296), Hasadiah (H2619), Jushab-hesed (H3142) and Abiud (G0010); also called Sheshbazzar at Esdras 1:8,11; 5.14,16; KJV: Zorobabel at Matthieu 1:12,13; 
§ Zerubbabel = "sown in Babylon"
the grandson of king Jehoiachin and leader of the first group of returning exiles from Babylon

