H2241.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 23:8; 
son of Libni (H3845G) ; 
brother of: Joel (H3100O) and Jehiel (H3171H) 
§ Zetham = "olive"
a Gershonite Levite, the son of Jehieli and grandson of Laadan

H2246.def:
A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Nombres 10:29; 
son of: Jethro (H3503); 
brother of: Zipporah (H6855) and Eliasaph (H0460) 
§ Hobab = "cherished"
the son of Reuel, the Midianite father-in-law of Moses, also known as Jethro, and brother-in-law of Moses

H2252.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Esdras 2:61; also called Hobaiah at Néhémie 7:63; 
§ Habaiah = "Jehovah has hidden"
head of a priestly family who returned from exile with Zerubbabel

H2268I.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah(?) living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:18; 
son of: Mered (H4778)(?) and Jehudijah (H3057); 
brother of: Jered (H3382H) and Jekuthiel (H3354); 
half-brother of: Miriam (H4813H)(?), Shammai (H8060I)(?) and Ishbah (H3431)(?); 
father of: Soco (H7755I)
§ Heber = "comrade"
1) the Kenite, husband of Jael, who slew Sisera by driving a nail into his temple
2) grandson of Asher from whom came the Heberites
3) father of Socho, a Judahite
4) a Benjamite
5) another Benjamite
6) a Gadite

H2275B.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 6:18; 
son of: Kohath (H6955); 
brother of: Amram (H6019), Izhar (H3324) and Uzziel (H5816); 
father of: Jeriah (H3404), Amariah (H0568I), Jahaziel (H3166I) and Jekameam (H3360)
Also named: chev.ro.ni (חֶבְרוֹנִי "Hebronite" H2276)
§ Hebron = "association"
1) the 3rd son of Kohath and grandson of Levi
2) a descendant of Caleb

